    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d261">

                <pb facs="0494" n="464" sameAs="frus:frus1947v01/pg464"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BC/4–2547:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the United States Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Austin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-04-25T20:00:00-05:00">April 25, 1947—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>185. Believe US should advocate (re Herschel Johnson letters March 29<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d261-f1"/> and April 15<anchor n="2" xml:id="d261-f2"/> to
                    Rusk) as initial SC action on receipt MSC report due April 30<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d261-f3"/> (<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>) prompt establishment
                    subcommittee representing all members SC, action
                    to be pursuant item 2 S/331<anchor n="4" xml:id="d261-f4"/> (if necessary USDel should request inclusion this item SC agenda), and <pb facs="0495" n="465"
                        xml:id="pg465"/> (<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>) direction MSC proceed urgently study Art. 43 as previously
                    directed.</p>
                <p>Subcommittee should review report, examine basic principles and consider further
                    action SC should take accelerate implementation
                    Art. 43 in accord GA Res Dec 14. It should report
                    recommendations SC soonest.</p>
                <p>Urge immediate informal discussion proposed action other SC members.</p>
                <p>Further recommendations including detailed subcommittee terms of ref
                        follow.<anchor n="5" xml:id="d261-f5"/>
                </p>
                <p>Strongly urge USDel take necessary action
                    earliest release MSC report.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
